                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Apply for Points-Tested Permanent Residency based on skills & study.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl">
                    <span class="text-xs font-black text-sky-400">STAGE 04</span>
